# Dig Up the Sea of Spores (Q356): a level 43 character accepts at Gauen through his pages; he
# waits for spores; a rotting tree gives a herb spore (every roll pinned to succeed) and he still
# waits; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q356_dig_up_the_sea_of_spores.golden
character Gauen 43
random always 0
script quest.Q356_DigUpTheSeaOfSpores
